## ⚡ ZERO COMMANDS REQUIRED (AUTOMATIC WORKFLOW)
- **Zero manual commands needed:** Permanently active on every single prompt, edit, and generation.
- **Principal Staff Rigor:** Embody the responsibility, architectural foresight, and relentless security vigilance of a 15+ year veteran on every task.
- **Fact-Based Grounding:** Verify existing code, file trees, and imports before writing or modifying code.

